team-2988120","kind":"update","title":"Never Be Alone — Demo Update #1 | Controls, Bug Fixes & Improvements","summary":"🛠️ Never Be Alone — Demo Update #1 Hello Survivors! ❤️ First of all, thank you for the incredible support since the demo launched! I've been reading through your bug reports, suggestions, and feedback, and I've spent the last 15 hours working on improvements and fixes. Normally, my number one rule is don't update a demo unless absolutely necessary. Every update carries the risk of introducing unexpected problems. However, with several players experiencing issues with WASD controls and the hotbar","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T00:10:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114027112","verified_at":"2026-10-21T01:24:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2988120-1846651706691453","game_id":"steam-2988120","kind":"announcement","title":"🎉 Never Be Alone — The Free Demo Is Finally Here!","summary":"🎉 Never Be Alone — The Free Demo Is Finally Here! Survivors, the day is finally here! ❤️ After almost 4 years of development, and 10 and a half months since I first started showing Never Be Alone to the world, we've finally reached one of the biggest milestones for our small team. The free demo of Never Be Alone is now available on Steam! It's honestly a little hard to believe we're here. What started as a passion project that I worked on during evenings and weekends alongside my full-time job h","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:00:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691453","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2988120-1842846814453307","game_id":"steam-2988120","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Trailer is Out! 🎬","summary":"Our Demo Trailer for Never Be Alone is finally out on Youtube! 🎬🧟We wanted to say a massive thank you. We've now crossed 185,500+ wishlists, and honestly, that number still doesn't feel real to us. Every wishlist, comment, and share genuinely fuels this project forward.The full Demo drops October 19th as part of Steam Next Fest, so this trailer is just a taste of what's coming.Go check out the trailer if you haven't already, and let us know what you think in the comments!Thank you for being part","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-07T14:56:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814453307","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2988120-1840944183774074","game_id":"steam-2988120","kind":"announcement","title":"Never Be Alone - New Trailer Coming Soon","summary":"Hey everyone,We are excited to share that a brand new trailer for Never Be Alone will be released on Friday the 21st at 19:00 Europe time.The trailer was made by UNVRZ and captured on June 1 using a playtest version, so some things may already have changed, improved, or been fixed since then in our newer demo build.We cannot wait to show it to you all and keep building hype for Never Be Alone as we move closer to the demo release in October.Hope to see you all there!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-12T14:05:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183774074","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2988120-1839676055892057","game_id":"steam-2988120","kind":"announcement","title":"Never Be Alone Creator Program Applications Are Now Open!","summary":"🎥 Never Be Alone Creator Program Applications are Open!Hello Survivors!With the demo getting closer, we're excited to announce that applications for the Never Be Alone Creator Program are now open!If you're a content creator and think your audience would enjoy Never Be Alone, we'd love to hear from you.Creators who are selected will receive:Early access to the demo before its public release.Extra Steam keys for community giveaways.Direct communication with the development team.Plenty of time to ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-02T06:21:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055892057","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2988120-1839041357038552","game_id":"steam-2988120","kind":"announcement","title":"Never Be Alone Is Officially Funded!","summary":"Hey everyone,I have some incredibly exciting news to share.Never Be Alone has officially been funded.Thanks to your support, wishlists, messages, shares, and continued interest in the project, I have received funding from a local bank that wants to help give Never Be Alone the best possible chance of becoming everything it can be before release.Because of this, from September 1st, I’ll be able to work full-time on the game.This is genuinely a dream come true.For almost four years, I have been de","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-28T15:04:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357038552","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2988120-1833968530887148","game_id":"steam-2988120","kind":"announcement","title":"🚀 150,000 Wishlists… Thank You ❤️","summary":"We honestly don’t even know what to say anymore.Never Be Alone has now passed 150,000 wishlists… and seeing those numbers continue to grow is something we never imagined possible.To every single person who has supported the game by wishlisting, sharing videos, joining the Discord, commenting, or simply following the journey. ❤️It’s hard to describe just how much this means to us.What started as a dream and a passion project has slowly turned into something much bigger, and none of it would be po","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-28T05:09:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530887148","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2988120-1832700592792832","game_id":"steam-2988120","kind":"announcement","title":"Never Be Alone is Joining Endix Showcase","summary":"We are incredibly excited to announce that Never Be Alone will officially be taking part in Endix Showcase May 23–24th 🎡For those who don’t know what Endix is:Endix Showcase is a free digital/virtual showcase built as a multiplayer experience inside Unreal Engine. Instead of watching a normal livestream, you can explore a massive digital world, discover upcoming games, interact with booths, and experience showcases in a much more immersive way.🎬 What can you expect from us?During the showcase, w","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-15T18:00:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832700592792832","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2988120-1829528821313361","game_id":"steam-2988120","kind":"announcement","title":"🚀 100,000 Wishlists… Thank You ❤️","summary":"🚀 100,000 Wishlists 🚀We honestly don’t even know where to begin.Never Be Alone has now passed 100,000 wishlists… and that’s something we never imagined reaching this fast - or even reaching at all.To every single one of you who clicked that wishlist button - thank you ❤️It might seem like a small action, but you have no idea how much it means to us. That single click genuinely helps push the game forward, opens doors, and in many ways… helps change our lives.The support we’ve received so far has","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-12T08:10:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1829528821313361","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2988120-1828441623113130","game_id":"steam-2988120","kind":"announcement","title":"🚀 70,000 Wishlists in 3 Months… Thank You ❤️","summary":"🚀 70,000 Wishlists in 3 Months 🚀It honestly feels unreal writing this.In just three months, Never Be Alone has passed 70,000+ wishlists… and we genuinely can’t thank you enough.The support, the messages, the feedback, the excitement. It all means more to us than we can properly put into words. Seeing so many of you believe in what we’re building makes every late night and every challenge worth it.And it’s not just wishlists.Our Discord community is getting close to 1,000 people, which is absolut","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-31T19:19:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1828441623113130","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2988120-1826362059926049","game_id":"steam-2988120","kind":"announcement","title":"Closed Playtest Wave 2 – Now Recruiting Testers","summary":"🚨 Closed Playtest – Wave 2 🚨After months of development and improvements based on feedback from our first testers, we’re ready to expand our closed playtest.We are now looking for a second wave of dedicated testers to help us push Never Be Alone even further.This playtest will focus on: • Bug hunting • Multiplayer & co-op stability • Performance across different hardware • Quality-of-life improvements⚠️ Important:This is a confidential test build. No streaming, screenshots, or sharing gameplay p","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-07T03:46:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1826362059926049","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2988120-1823825466500514","game_id":"steam-2988120","kind":"announcement","title":"🚀 1 Month In – 45,000+ Wishlists! Thank You!","summary":"🚀 One Month – 45,000+ Wishlists! 🚀It’s honestly mind-blowing to be writing this. In just one month, Never Be Alone has passed 45,000+ wishlists — and the amount of support, feedback, and excitement around the game means more than we can properly put into words.Seeing something we’ve poured so much time, passion, and energy into resonate with so many of you is incredibly motivating. Knowing that others are genuinely excited about what we’re building makes every late night and iteration worth it.W","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-06T18:41:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1823825466500514","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2988120-1821922921821614","game_id":"steam-2988120","kind":"announcement","title":"Never Be Alone hits 30,000 Wishlists!","summary":"🎉 30,000 Wishlists – Thank You! 🎉This is a huge milestone for Never Be Alone, and honestly… still a bit unreal.We officially started on January 1st, and just three days later, one of our videos really took off. Fast forward to today, January 19th, 2026, and we’ve now reached 30,000 wishlists… on my birthday no less 🎂Seeing this level of support so early means more than I can put into words. It’s a massive motivation boost and a clear sign that the time and passion poured into this project is wor","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-01-19T16:35:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1821922921821614","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2988120-1821288646586670","game_id":"steam-2988120","kind":"announcement","title":"Thank You for 18,000 Wishlists — We’re Truly Grateful 💙","summary":"Hi everyone,I just want to take a moment to say thank you so much for all the love and support.Because of you, we’ve now passed 18,000 wishlists, which is honestly unreal. You have no idea how much this means. I’m incredibly proud of myself, the team, and every single person who’s shown love for this game.From the very beginning, my dream was to create something special together with a team I truly love working with, and alongside an amazing community that has our back. The people in our Discord","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-01-12T19:43:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1821288646586670","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2988120-1821288646577713","game_id":"steam-2988120","kind":"update","title":"Never Be Alone: Update on Development & Future Plans","summary":"Hi everyone,I wanted to share a small update about the future development cycle of Never Be Alone.The response to the game has honestly gone way beyond anything I ever expected. The amount of views, comments, and wishlists in such a short time has been overwhelming in the best possible way. Thank you to everyone who’s taken the time to watch, comment, and support the game by wishlisting 